  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Plumping</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A high-impact clean lip plumper with a satisfying warming-cooling tingle for visibly fuller, glassy lips—always nourishing, not sticky or drying.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Lip Plumper<br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Hydrating, Plumping<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Capsicum Frutescens (Chili pepper) Fruit Extract and Ginger Root Oil: Supports blood flow to lips. <br>- Menthyl Lactate: Rapidly cools and refreshes. <br>- Menthyl Nicotinate and Vanillyl Butyl Ether: Delivers antioxidant protection and a tingling, warming micro massage. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Custom plumping complex delivers a sensorial experience</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply within the perimeter of lips where plumping is desired. <br>-Tingling sensation may vary. Temporary redness may occur if applied outside the lips.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Capsicum Frutescens (Chili pepper) Fruit Extract and Ginger Root Oil: Supports blood flow to lips. <br>-Menthyl Lactate: Rapidly cools and refreshes. <br>-Menthyl Nicotinate and Vanillyl Butyl Ether: Delivers antioxidant protection and a tingling, warming micro massage. <br><br>Polybutene, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Tridecyl Trimellitate, Dextrin Palmitate, Dextrin Palmitate/Ethylhexanoate, Menthyl Nicotinate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil Unsaponifiables, Calcium Aluminum Borosilicate, Menthyl Lactate, Methyl Nicotinate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Vanillyl Butyl Ether, Canola Oil, Capsicum Frutescens Fruit Extract, Zingiber Officinale (Ginger) Root Oil, Menthol, Tin Oxide, Vanillin, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Fragrance (Parfum) [+/-: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 28 Lake (CI 45410)].<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
